      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.48075211267605633,
        "y0": 0.5356327586206896,
        "x1": 0.9220647887323944,
        "y1": 0.5655172413793104
      },
      "text": "The stage-box in a theatre was formerly so called. Jonson. LORDSWYK. A traitor. Eifson.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.29295774647887324,
        "y0": 0.5517241379310345,
        "x1": 0.46948450704225353,
        "y1": 0.5655172413793104
      },
      "text": "MS. Harl. 1701, f. 79.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.48075211267605633,
        "y0": 0.5620689655172414,
        "x1": 0.8103295774647886,
        "y1": 0.5787362068965518
      },
      "text": "LORDSWYK A traitor. Ritson.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.10704225352112676,
        "y0": 0.5655172413793104,
        "x1": 0.35492957746478876,
        "y1": 0.5804603448275862
      },
      "text": "The portar set the yatys opon,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.4788732394366197,
        "y0": 0.5758620689655172,
        "x1": 0.9201887323943662,
        "y1": 0.6068965517241379
      },
      "text": "LORE. (1) Knowledge ; doctrine advice. ( A.-S) (2) Lost. Still in use in Somerset.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.10704225352112676,
        "y0": 0.5781603448275863,
        "x1": 0.38591549295774646,
        "y1": 0.5936775862068966
      },
      "text": "And with that Befyse ys owt lopon.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.2769943661971831,
        "y0": 0.5896551724137931,
        "x1": 0.4676056338028169,
        "y1": 0.603448275862069
      },
      "text": "Cantab Ff. ii. 38, f. 108.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.10798028169014084,
        "y0": 0.603448275862069,
        "x1": 0.3849774647887324,
        "y1": 0.6310344827586207
      },
      "text": "Anoon was al that feire gederynge Lopen undir oure lordes wynge.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.559625352112676,
        "y0": 0.603448275862069,
        "x1": 0.8507042253521127,
        "y1": 0.6183913793103448
      },
      "text": "The kyng seld, Take me thy tayle,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5577464788732395,
        "y0": 0.6160913793103449,
        "x1": 0.8469492957746478,
        "y1": 0.6310344827586207
      },
      "text": "For my hors wolde not the fayle,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.559625352112676,
        "y0": 0.6287362068965517,
        "x1": 0.7455408450704225,
        "y1": 0.6425293103448275
      },
      "text": "A peny that thou lore.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.10516338028169013,
        "y0": 0.6402293103448276,
        "x1": 0.3643183098591549,
        "y1": 0.6540224137931034
      },
      "text": "Sythen he ys lopen on hys stede,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.4788732394366197,
        "y0": 0.6505741379310345,
        "x1": 0.916430985915493,
        "y1": 0.6816086206896552
      },
      "text": "Ff. v. 48, f. 61. LORE FAD YR. A teacher. Loremastir, Dial. Great. Moral, p. 243. Of al men they do most evy].",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.10516338028169013,
        "y0": 0.65115,
        "x1": 0.3737098591549296,
        "y1": 0.6655172413793103
      },
      "text": "He with hym Harrawde dud lede.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.028169014084507043,
        "y0": 0.6632189655172414,
        "x1": 0.4676056338028169,
        "y1": 0.7086206896551723
      },
      "text": "MS: Cantab. Ff. ii. 38, f. 154. LOPE-STAFF. leaping-staff: lope-staffe wherewith men leape ditches, Cotgrave:",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5183098591549296,
        "y0": 0.6781603448275861,
        "x1": 0.7511746478873239,
        "y1": 0.693103448275862
      },
      "text": "Of al men they do most evyl,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.4788732394366197,
        "y0": 0.6902293103448276,
        "x1": 0.9173718309859155,
        "y1": 0.7183913793103449
      },
      "text": "Here lorefadyr ys thedevyl. MS. Harl. 1701, f 24, LOREINE. A rcin. Sce Lannfal , 888",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.028169014084507043,
        "y0": 0.7017241379310345,
        "x1": 0.468543661971831,
        "y1": 0.7321844827586207
      },
      "text": "LOPIRD.   Coagulated. Still iu use.  See Forby, Brockett, Grose, Kennett, &c.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5577464788732395,
        "y0": 0.7160913793103448,
        "x1": 0.8338028169014085,
        "y1": 0.7408051724137932
      },
      "text": "Hys loreine lemyd alle with pride, Stede and armure alle was blake",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.0676056338028169,
        "y0": 0.7298844827586206,
        "x1": 0.33427323943661974,
        "y1": 0.7436775862068965
      },
      "text": "Thare he fande none other fode,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.0676056338028169,
        "y0": 0.7413793103448276,
        "x1": 0.36244225352112674,
        "y1": 0.7574706896551724
      },
      "text": "Bot wlatesome glcte and lopird blcde",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.7427239436619718,
        "y0": 0.7419534482758621,
        "x1": 0.9136140845070423,
        "y1": 0.753448275862069
      },
      "text": "2lf5:. 22.52, f. 104.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.4788732394366197,
        "y0": 0.753448275862069,
        "x1": 0.9192478873239437,
        "y1": 0.8229879310344828
      },
      "text": "LOREL. A bad worthless fellow. {A.-N.) Lorels den, Holinshed, Chron. Ireland, p. 93. Cocke Lorel was formerly a generic title for a very great rascal. \" Lasy lorrels,\" Harman, 1567. LOREMAR. A bit-maker. Palsgrave. \"Lori-",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.2882619718309859,
        "y0": 0.755746551724138,
        "x1": 0.39154929577464787,
        "y1": 0.7660913793103448
      },
      "text": "Lincoln A.l.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.06854366197183098,
        "y0": 0.7683913793103448,
        "x1": 0.20187887323943662,
        "y1": 0.7798844827586207
      },
      "text": "Thare dwelled a",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.2056338028169014,
        "y0": 0.7718396551724138,
        "x1": 0.24131549295774649,
        "y1": 0.7798844827586207
      },
      "text": "man",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.06854366197183098,
        "y0": 0.7810344827586206,
        "x1": 0.1267605633802817,
        "y1": 0.7925293103448277
      },
      "text": "And In myrke donjowne, in fowle stede of corrupcyowne,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.0676056338028169,
        "y0": 0.7908051724137931,
        "x1": 0.2591549295774648,
        "y1": 0.8057465517241379
      },
      "text": "Whare he had no fode,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.0676056338028169,
        "y0": 0.804598275862069,
        "x1": 0.37746478873239436,
        "y1": 0.8183913793103448
      },
      "text": "Bot wlatsome glette and lopyrd blode.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.4769943661971831,
        "y0": 0.8206896551724138,
        "x1": 0.916430985915493,
        "y1": 0.8632189655172414
      },
      "text": "LOREMAR bit-maker. Palsgrave. Lori . mers or bit-makers; Harrison; p. 97. LORENGE. Iron.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.026290140845070423,
        "y0": 0.8270120689655173,
        "x1": 0.4657267605633803,
        "y1": 0.8597706896551724
      },
      "text": "p. 25. LOP-LOACH. The leech used by surgeons for drawing blood. North. LOPLOLLY. A lazy fellow. West.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
