      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.028169014084507043,
        "y0": 0.8666672413793104,
        "x1": 0.2892028169014085,
        "y1": 0.8844827586206897
      },
      "text": "LOPPING. Lame. Dorset.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5577464788732395,
        "y0": 0.8758620689655172,
        "x1": 0.7887323943661971,
        "y1": 0.8896551724137931
      },
      "text": "Thís Daphne into a lorer tre",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.026290140845070423,
        "y0": 0.8810344827586207,
        "x1": 0.379343661971831,
        "y1": 0.896551724137931
      },
      "text": "LOP-SIDED. Var. dial",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.559625352112676,
        "y0": 0.8873568965517241,
        "x1": 0.8328647887323943,
        "y1": 0.9017241379310345
      },
      "text": "Was turnid, whiche is ever grene.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.028169014084507043,
        "y0": 0.8942534482758621,
        "x1": 0.4657267605633803,
        "y1": 0.9258620689655173
      },
      "text": "LOP-START. The stoat. East . It is mentioned in Harrison's England, P. 230.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5389661971830986,
        "y0": 0.9137931034482758,
        "x1": 0.8507042253521127,
        "y1": 0.9275862068965517
      },
      "text": "And plaunted trees that wcre to prelse,",
      "html": null,
